      "known_gaps": [
        "link.exe aborts on the missing kernel32 import lstrcmpiW. Also missing GetTempPathW, CopyFileW, ExpandEnvironmentStringsW, FormatMessageW. lstrcmpiW and GetTempPathW are implemented in wibo main but not in 1.2.0.",
        "1.2.0 throws an uncaught filesystem_error if any PATH entry cannot be stat'ed, which happens when /usr/local/bin is root-only. This action pins PATH to avoid it.",
        "cl.exe and ml.exe are unaffected: c1/c1xx/c2 are in-process DLLs, and /Z7 avoids mspdbsrv entirely."
      ]
    }
  }
